rom `git status`; your candidate paths are internal/sessstate/sessstate.go, internal/sessstate/ownership_properties_test.go, internal/sessrepo/lease_properties_test.go, internal/fencing/ownership_properties_test.go, internal/fencing/gate_test.go, internal/sessstate/testdata/mutate_properties.py, internal/sessstate/census_state_test.go, internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json, internal/traceability/traceability.go, internal/traceability/traceability_test.go, internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck/main_test.go, README.md, LOGBOOK.md); LOGBOOK.md must end up with all four 2026-09-17 entries newest-first by wall time — 2atgj4 (yours), 3lt2xv (trunk), 3g12yp, 2f5393 — and its diff against HEAD purely additive; README.md must keep trunk's rewritten cataloggen tool row AND your property-suite section/row; (5) rerun the full 26-command suite from the worktree's task-board.config.json (== trunk's; command 21 is the -adopted form) and the property suites; (6) verify `git status` shows exactly the 13 candidate paths (no __pycache__/.pyc), attach UPDATED outcomes TASK-260830-2atgj4_results-rev2.md (the refresh/reconcile record with exact commands, OIDs and the LOGBOOK/README reconciliation), TASK-260830-2atgj4_conformance-matrix-rev2.md, TASK-260830-2atgj4_producer-evidence-rev2.tar.gz (a real gzip archive) — a handoff without a new or updated task-scoped outcome is cancelled as handoff_unsatisfied; (7) task-board handoff TASK-260830-2atgj4 --role developer and exit promptly. Do not re-implement or change product code beyond the reconciliation; never commit on the Story branch; never edit .task-board directly; never self-accept; never edit the control root. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: muse-spark max.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
