g, traceability,\n62|  sessquery) differ. Each replayed checkpoint's own file set is\n63|  intact except the LOGBOOK resolution.\n64|\n65|## Candidate reconciliation (by hand, no wholesale checkout)\n66|\n67|`git checkout HEAD -- task-board.config.json\n68|internal/catalog/catalog.go internal/catalog/catalog_test.go\n69|internal/catalog/cmd/cataloggen/main.go\n70|internal/catalog/cmd/cataloggen/main_test.go .task-board`\n71|restored every trunk-changed path outside the 13 candidate paths\n72|(`task-board.config.json` now equals HEAD, zero diff).\n73|\n74|- LOGBOOK.md: inserted trunk's 3lt2xv block verbatim between the\n75|  candidate 2atgj4 block and the 3g12yp block. Order is now\n76|  2atgj4, 3lt2xv, 3g12yp, 2f5393 (newest-first by wall time);\n77|  `git diff` vs HEAD is purely additive (48 insertions, 0\n78|  deletions).\n79|- README.md: restored trunk's `-adopted` regenerate block and\n80|  Go-toolchain row cell verbatim; kept the candidate\n81|  property-suite section, the `ownership properties` harness\n82|  table row, and the 110->113 count. Diff vs HEAD: 64\n83|  insertions, 1 deletion (the count line only).\n84|\n85|`git status` shows exactly the 13 candidate paths (9 modified +\n86|`internal/fencing/ownership_properties_test.go`,\n87|`internal/sessrepo/lease_properties_test.go`,\n88|`internal/sessstate/ownership_properties_test.go`,\n89|`internal/sessstate/testdata/mutate_properties.py`); no\n90|`__pycache__`, no `.pyc`.\n91|\n92|## Re-run validation on the fresh base (all local, real exits)\n93|\n94|Full 26-command suite from `task-board.config.json` (command 21\n95|is the `-adopted` form), all exit 0:\n96|\n97|| # | Command | Result |\n98|| --- | --- | --- |\n99|| 1 | gofmt clean | OK (empty) |\n100|| 2 | `go build ./...` | exit 0 |\n101|| 3 | `go vet ./...` | exit 0 |\n102|| 4 | `go test ./... -count=1 -v` | exit 0; 27 ok, 0 FAIL; 19910 `--- PASS` |\n103|| 5 | `go test ./... -race -count=1` | exit 0; 27 ok, 0 FAIL |\n104|| 6 | `go test ./... -cover -count=1` | exit 0; 27 ok (sessstate 92.4%, sessrepo 86.6%, fencing 97.5%) |\n105|| 7-11 | scalar + canonicaljson fuzz | 5/5 pass |\n106|| 12-19 | secconftest fuzz | 8/8 pass |\n107|| 20 | tracecheck | exit 0 (`acceptance_cases=113`, `clauses_discharged=28/485`) |\n108|| 21 | cataloggen `-adopted -check` | exit 0 |\n109|| 22-23 | linux/windows cross builds | exit 0 |\n110|| 24 | JSON validation | exit 0 |\n111|| 25 | `task-board validate` | exit 0 (191 pre-existing board notices) |\n112|| 26 | `git diff --check` | exit 0 |\n113|\n114|Property suites on the fresh base:\n115|\n116|- Focused `go test ./internal/sessstate ./internal/sessrepo\n117|  ./internal/fencing -run '^TestOwnership' -count=1`: exit 0,\n118|  all 11 properties pass\n119|  (`props-focused.log`).\n120|- Mutation battery `mutate_properties.py`: harness exit 0; all\n121|  8 `N-` plants KILLED by their named properties\n122|  (`N-compare-tiebreak` and `N-union-detail-first` by\n123|  `TestOwnershipUnionOrderIndependent`, both loser-drop plants\n124|  by `TestOwnershipLoserHistoryPreserved`, `N-create-clock` by\n125|  `TestOwnershipStoreClockNonAuthority`, `N-expiry-absolute` by\n126|  `TestOwnershipGateClockNonAuthority`, both gate plants by\n127|  `TestOwnershipGateSingleAuthorizedOwner`);\n128|  `C-harmless-comment` SURVIVED (applied),\n129|  `C-not-applied` NOT_APPLIED, `C-compile-failure`\n130|  COMPILE_OR_HARNESS_FAILURE; both controls exit 0\n131|  (`mutants-run.log`, `mutants/mutants-full.json` + per-plant\n132|  raw logs).\n133|\n134|The indented `--- FAIL` lines inside the verbose suite log are\n135|the expected inner-harness plant failures captured by passing\n136|tests; top-level `^FAIL` count is 0 in every batch.\n137|\n138|## Evidence attached (rev2)\n139|\n140|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_results-rev2.md` (this file)\n141|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_conformance-matrix-rev2.md`\n142|- `TASK-260830-2atgj4_producer-evidence-rev2.tar.gz` (real\n143|  gzip: 26-command logs, focused property log, mutation\n144| 